# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if having machine-specific problems in Pipfile.lock,
#   it is advisable to not include it, as the dependency changes are hardcoded in the lock file.
#   If you do include Pipfile.lock, please replace the "#" signs below.
